<title>USA: Sedgwick Cty, Kan., $9.625 mln won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Sedgwick Cty, Kan., $9.625 mln won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $9.625 million of Sedgwick Cty, Kan., general obligation bond, Series A, 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.589 percent.</p>
</text>
